				},
				{
					"id": 220280904,
					"content": "不过，大伯说，他的那些对手似乎都有些身体上的…不适…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280905,
						220280906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280905,
					"content": "这神明怎么这么没谱呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280907,
					"content": "不过无论如何，大家都觉得这也是神明显灵了。所以向这个神龛许愿，我觉得应该也能得到回应。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280908,
					"content": "先不说这些了！这一次，我们供奉什么比较好呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280909,
					"content": "和那个大伯一样，供奉铁矿石的话，或许也能得到回应！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280910,
					"content": "我在铁匠铺门口捡到过几块矿石，不过，它们的品质都不太好，铁匠师傅觉得送给我都无所谓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280911,
					"content": "还有…我之前在这附近采了些新鲜海草，然后把它们煮一煮，撒上糖…这么吃起来味道可好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280912,
					"content": "就是不知道，神明大人喜不喜欢吃这种小凉菜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280913,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，你觉得呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				},
				{
					"id": 220280906,
					"content": "其他人退步，自己就算进步了吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220280907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "翔太"
				}
			]
		},
